OL,3,GNEWSAHospitality firms urge public
OL,4,Asupport this winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FPub, cafe and restaurant owners in
OL,7,FWorcestershire said they need the
OL,8,Fpublic's support "more than ever" this
OL,9,Fwinter - after coming together in a
OL,10,Fspecial gathering.
OL,12,FAround 70 businesses took part in a
OL,13,F'hospitality summit' organised by
OL,14,FWychavon District Council on Monday,
OL,15,Fthe first event of its kind in the
OL,16,Farea.
OL,18,FThe summit was aimed at hearing their
OL,19,Fconcerns, and passing on details of
OL,20,Fwhat help is available from the
OL,21,Fcouncil, in the wake of last week's
OL,22,FBudget.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
